earned this extension that will cost you $1 , 180 over the next 10 years (on top of the money","x":122,"y":581,"w":2153,"h":50},{"text":"you are already paying)?","x":119,"y":644,"w":530,"h":47},{"text":"Let's look at the student test scores for English learners attaining English proficiency:","x":122,"y":749,"w":1795,"h":48},{"text":"2024-25 school year results: 45.55% below meeting proficiency standards.","x":119,"y":852,"w":1648,"h":48},{"text":"Source: California Department of Education (ED-DATA.ORG)","x":120,"y":955,"w":1304,"h":48},{"text":"If you got 54.45% of the answers right on a test, that would be an F grade, would it not?","x":122,"y":1058,"w":1852,"h":49},{"text":"Should you, the voters, reward a 45.55% failure rate?","x":119,"y":1162,"w":1134,"h":46},{"text":"STOP FUNDING FAILURE","x":119,"y":1266,"w":584,"h":37},{"text":"Please vote NO on Measure","x":120,"y":1370,"w":615,"h":36},{"text":"Let's look at the student test scores for math:","x":120,"y":1473,"w":951,"h":38},{"text":"2024-25 school year results: 48.39% below meeting proficiency standards.","x":118,"y":1578,"w":1647,"h":47},{"text":"The Pacifica School District spends $16,006 per student per year.","x":118,"y":1680,"w":1392,"h":47},{"text":"The measure says that none of the funds will be used for administration. But, funds generated","x":118,"y":1785,"w":2000,"h":49},{"text":"separately from this parcel tax can be used for administration expenses without limits. Administrators","x":118,"y":1848,"w":2149,"h":48},{"text":"increased from 11 in 2020 to 14 in 2025 and staff for \"Pupil Services\" doubled from 6 to 12. While","x":119,"y":1912,"w":2068,"h":48},{"text":"enrollment declined!","x":118,"y":1976,"w":467,"h":36},{"text":"Do not be fooled.","x":119,"y":2080,"w":387,"h":36},{"text":"Here are the latest average teacher salaries for the district:","x":120,"y":2183,"w":1244,"h":47},{"text":"2023-24 - teacher average salary = $76,602 + benefits $30, 748 = $107,350.","x":118,"y":2286,"w":1484,"h":43},{"text":"And teachers only work an average of 184 days a year.","x":116,"y":2385,"w":1076,"h":44},{"text":"Tell the Pacifica School Board to be fiscally responsible by voting NO on Measure","x":118,"y":2484,"w":1758,"h":47},{"text":"STOP FUNDING FAILURE","x":119,"y":2587,"w":582,"h":37},{"text":"For more information: http://www.svtaxpayers.org","x":121,"y":2691,"w":1043,"h":47},{"text":"FILED","x":1700,"y":2679,"w":93,"h":32},{"text":"OFFICE OF THE CHIEF ELECTIONS OFFICER","x":1386,"y":2723,"w":723,"h":46},{"text":"MA","x":1378,"y":3002,"w":49,"h":33},{"text":"BY:","x":1376,"y":3073,"w":51,"h":33},{"text":"SAN MATEO COUNTY","x":1573,"y":2776,"w":346,"h":38},{"text":"AUG 1 1 2026","x":1611,"y":2889,"w":262,"h":51},{"text":"S OFFICER","x":1927,"y":3012,"w":180,"h":37}]}]}
